{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:31.229Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"なんか学校の先生が「私たちは LLM の使用を検知するツールを持っている」と言っていたけどあれは本当なのかな？ってことで調べてみる"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"そもそものLLMの仕組みについて"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"うろ覚えだけど、AIが文章を返す仕組みって、簡単に言えば、「前の単語はこうだったから、次の単語はこうだろう」みたいなノリで出力していたはず。なので、どんなプロンプトを使ったかが分かれば、出力はある程度予測できるはず。[^どうやって？]"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"でも、プロンプトがわからない場合、どうやるんだろう？どんなデータを学習させたかによって結構さがありそうだけど、メジャーなモデルだったらだいぶわかるものなのかね。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"OpenAI"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pb","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pa","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"OpenAIは、過去にAI検出用のソフトウェアを公開していた。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pe","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pd","_type":"span","marks":["pc"],"text":"https://openai.com/ja-JP/index/new-ai-classifier-for-indicating-ai-written-text/"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"pc","_type":"link","href":"https://openai.com/ja-JP/index/new-ai-classifier-for-indicating-ai-written-text/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pf","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ただ、精度はあんまり良くはなかったみたいで、実用には至っていないはず。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pi","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"ph","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Quillbot"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pk","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pj","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"前の高校で使っている人たくさんいた。AI検出器と、パラフレーズ（単語を他の単語に置き換える）機能を同じアプリで提供しているという、なんとしても課題をAIにやらせようする学生をターゲットにしたサービス。それ以外にもいろいろツールを提供している。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pm","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pl","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Turnitin"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pr","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"自分が通っている"},{"_key":"pp","_type":"span","marks":["po"],"text":"慶應SFC"},{"_key":"pq","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"で、「この講義ではTurnitinを使っているのでお前らのAI使用はバレバレだよ！」というメッセージが書いてある事がある。"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"po","_type":"link","href":"/ja/works/keio/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pu","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pt","_type":"span","marks":["ps"],"text":"https://www.turnitin.com/"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"ps","_type":"link","href":"https://www.turnitin.com/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pw","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pv","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"調べたところ、Turnitinは、教育機関向けに、AI、文章の盗用（コピペ）の検出など、先生が使いたそうなツールを提供しているらしい。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"py","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"px","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"wip"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p10","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pz","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"この記事は work in progress（つくりかけ）だし、自分がLLMの深いとこの知識がなくてあんまりわからないので、誰か何か知っていたらぜひ教えてください〜"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p11","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"[＾どうやって？]: いい感じの参考文書とかないかな？"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"学校とかでChatGPT(LLM)などのAIツールの使用を禁止されたことはないだろうか。一時期はOpenAIなどがLLMが書いた文章を検出するソフトウェアなどを試験艇に公開していたが、現在はそういったものは調べてもあまり出てこない。果たしてLLMの使用を確実に検知することはできるのか？","emoji":"🤖","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2025-10-06T00:00:00.000Z","title":"LLMの使用は検知できるのか","translation":null},"id":"01M3TQXV6XRC7TBCX4YVEDFW2T","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2025-10-06T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"detect-llm-usage","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9FP17FKF8Y1P7W5ASMV2","label":"技術","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"tech","translationGroup":"01M40J9FDXNYKZKQHP12N415DK"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9P124AQSVB6697TTM18A","label":"brain-storming","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"brain-storming","translationGroup":"01M40J9NSBNVH7C75F1XY03KQ6"},{"id":"01M40J9V5528R96NRM2HEDVVBW","label":"llm","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"llm","translationGroup":"01M40J9TWK808PYTPW2A7ZZ12Z"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3TQXV6XRC7TBCX4YVEDFW2T"}
